  "basis": "Mapped Red Tower way91447984 carries ref:nicpmi00033, matching the national inventory for Saint Agatha’s Tower and the custodian name/website. Entrance node3898282959 is on the southeast-facing wall and establishes signed native+Z. +X follows the mapped entrance facade toward east-northeast. The projected outline preserves the four slightly unequal corner turrets; scarped foundation and roof elevations are reconstructed from custodian photographs, not claimed surveyed.",
