    "verified": "2026-10-02",
    "finding": "The national inventory identifies 00033 as St. Agatha’s Tower in Mellieha, managed by Din l-Art Helwa. Mapped way 91447984 has the same inventory reference, Red Tower name and custodian website; it has no Wikidata tag. The identity is established through the inventory reference, not an exact-QID map tag."
